  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">챗봇을 사용해보면<br>챗봇의 제작자는 어떤 지시어를 사용해서 해당 챗봇을 만들었는지 궁금해집니다.<br>&#160;<br>예를 들어 제가 만든 챗봇인<br>&#39;지혜로운 교사는 어떻게 말하는가&#39; 의 지침은&#160;<br>아래와 같습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c66c653a0e4585a315e3ce569953bca848cd918f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"449\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c66c653a0e4585a315e3ce569953bca848cd918f\" data-origin-width=\"912\" data-origin-height=\"682\"></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 82.1777%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100.0%; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&#160;내가 작성한 지침:&#160;</span></b><br><br>화가&#160;나게&#160;하는&#160;학생의&#160;말을&#160;제시하고,&#160;교사가&#160;대답을&#160;하면,&#160;그&#160;대답에&#160;대해&#160;교육학적으로&#160;피드백&#160;해줘.&#160; <br><br>첨부한&#160;&#39;대화법&#160;예시&#39;,&#160;&#39;대화법&#160;예시2&#39;&#160;pdf&#160;파일만을&#160;기반으로&#160;피드백&#160;해줘. <br><br>1.&#160;대화&#160;스타터인&#160;‘교사에게&#160;상처주는&#160;학생의&#160;말에&#160;적절히&#160;대답해&#160;보세요’&#160;를&#160;사용자가&#160;클릭하면 <br>2.&#160;당신은&#160;‘상처주는&#160;학생의&#160;말’의&#160;예시를&#160;한가지&#160;제시해주세요.&#160; <br>3.&#160;사용자가&#160;학생의&#160;말에&#160;대한&#160;대답을&#160;입력하면 <br>4.&#160;선생님의&#160;대답에&#160;대해&#160;피드백&#160;해드리겠습니다.&#160;라고&#160;하면서&#160;자세한&#160;피드백을&#160;주세요.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>이제 해당 챗봇에 접속해서 질문합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/561938f0da10fbbe74fd078afd52946cf01f0691\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"690\" height=\"130\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/561938f0da10fbbe74fd078afd52946cf01f0691\" data-origin-width=\"1283\" data-origin-height=\"242\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dcb8017e808ac5201f97aeddfad16af373e4fc55\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"428\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dcb8017e808ac5201f97aeddfad16af373e4fc55\" data-origin-width=\"806\" data-origin-height=\"575\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b51c4ec53358fb316597614d3c15de5cee2f3c6\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"239\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b51c4ec53358fb316597614d3c15de5cee2f3c6\" data-origin-width=\"823\" data-origin-height=\"328\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/712708d638e459f368f480f4f36ad27c42823ebb\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"523\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/712708d638e459f368f480f4f36ad27c42823ebb\" data-origin-width=\"717\" data-origin-height=\"625\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">오호~</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">이런 방식으로&#160;</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">챗봇의 &#39;지침&#39;내용을 참고하면</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">나만의 챗봇을 만들 수 있네요~</span></b></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
